config BR2_PACKAGE_PLAYOS_OVERLAY
	bool "playos-overlay"
	help
	  Trusted in-game overlay rendered as a Raylib Wayland client.
	  Pre-spawned and hidden by playos-init; the compositor maps/unmaps
	  it in response to the reserved SYSTEM button. Shows the active
	  game, elapsed time, and system status, and offers Resume (A) and
	  Quit game (B) actions.
